msgstr "Pufa z grubej tkaniny z miękkim siedzeniem, która wprowadza przytulną atmosferę."

#. Key:	Object_E01_Chair01_v04_DisplayNameTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/E01/Data/String/Data/ST_Object.ST_Object
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "가구 배치용 1인 스툴 이름 (글로서리 포함)"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /E01/Data/String/Data/ST_Object.ST_Object
