msgstr "Niedrogi dom"

#. Key:	BuildPreset_Cahaya_Residence_NPCSite1_02_DescriptionTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/E01/Data/String/UI/ST_BuildPreset.ST_BuildPreset
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "주택 프리셋 선택 UI 상세 설명"
